WEBVTT

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.860
9/20

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.860
9/20

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.570
Seiin vs Fukuho Practice Match

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.570
Seiin vs Fukuho Practice Match

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.560
Let's play!

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.850
Thanks for inviting us over today.
Let's have a good game.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.810
Right!

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.600
Coach Ichijodani, thank you so much for--

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.600
No worries. Show them how it's done today.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:33.480
Oh, and if you have any pointers
for us, please let us know!

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.480
Hey, is there a sink somewhere?
I didn't put in my contacts yet.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:36.980
Sure. There's one in front of
the changing room. You can use that.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.150
Thanks.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.900
Haijima, don't go off on your own!

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.310
The match ain't going anywhere!

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.560
We're at another school! Shut up!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.940
I put the net up at 2.43, but you
want me to bring it down to 2.40?

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.520
Nah, that's fine. We play with 2.43, too.

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:56.940
Huh…

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:00.980
Though we've never played
an official match at 2.43.

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:05.810
Guess you guys have played
nationals more than once.

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:10.020
This is the first time we're
playing 2.43. That's awesome.

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:13.770
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:16.150
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:16.150 --> 00:01:21.100
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

